WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.820
Departures: scheduled departures (tours, boats, shuttles): seats per departure, weekly patterns and the passenger manifest.

2
00:00:11.374 --> 00:00:17.640
Create the week's repeating departures at once with "Weekly pattern", or click "New departure".

3
00:00:18.187 --> 00:00:21.650
Set the "Price per person" and the "Minimum to run".

4
00:00:22.204 --> 00:00:29.590
On the day, open the manifest; if a departure doesn't reach the minimum, cancel it so passengers are told.

5
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:34.000
Don't cancel late; passengers have planned to get there.
